WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/dashboard/components/TemplateGallery.tsx — a Modal that swaps IN PLACE between:
    GALLERY : StaggerContainer grid → a dashed "Blank Dashboard" card (onApply('__blank__'))
                                     + one TemplateCard per DASHBOARD_PRESETS entry
              TemplateCard = MiniGridPreview + name + <Badge>{widgets.length}</Badge> + desc(line-clamp-2)
                             + useCategoryIcons() row (first widget icon per category, max 5)
    DETAIL  : FadeIn → MiniGridPreview(h-48) + name + desc + "{{count}} widgets"
                       + 2-col widget grid (def.icon + def.name) + [Back] [Use This Template]
    title   : selected ? t('templates.detail') : t('templates.title')   (dynamic, in the Modal chrome)
  Data: DASHBOARD_PRESETS (10 presets) + getWidgetDef (registry) + buildDefaultLayouts (lg auto-flow pack) +
        useCategoryIcons (pure useMemo). NO fetch -> the web carries NO loading/error/stale/offline branch;
        the preset catalog is a static client-seed import, available offline by construction.
  Data sources listed by the prompt: useTranslation (P1/S10 i18n) · useCategoryIcons (pure derivation).

